flowchart LR

    %% The natural history: what the disease does (every agent has a stage)
    subgraph Stages[Stages: natural history]
        direction LR
        S[Susceptible] -->|infection, if free| E[Exposed]
        E -->|latent period| I[Infected]
        I -->|recovery rate,<br>or discharge| R[Recovered]
    end

    %% The statuses: where the agent is (who it meets)
    subgraph Statuses[Statuses: the model's states]
        direction LR
        F[Free]
        Q[Quarantined]
        Is[Isolated]
        H[Hospitalized]
        F -->|traced contact| Q
        Q -->|period over| F
        F -->|detected, if willing;<br>traced while infected| Is
        Q -->|onset| Is
        Is -->|period over| F
        F -->|infected: daily risk| H
        Is -->|infected: daily risk| H
        H -->|discharge| F
    end
